- op: discuss  # f1ad
  at: '2026-05-30T09:06:42Z'  # f1ad
  by: agent  # f1ad
  actor: jgstern_agent  # f1ad
  clock: 3  # f1ad
  nonce: f1ad  # f1ad
  message: "Cross-ref backfill (2026-05-30, deeper-issue investigation): WI-gipop (done) unified the matcher rules used by slice and explain but did not unify the post-match policy: slice raises AmbiguousEntryError (slice.py:493), explain iterates all matches without warning (cli.py:2003 enumerate(matches)). The shared helper that resolves a user-supplied entry spec to a symbol should also decide ambiguity policy. Co-fixable with INV-nugos and WI-kutam — both file the slice ambiguity error template separately; consolidating the error path lets all three be fixed in one place."  # f1ad
